  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 18th September 2003, the proposed roof extension, as shown on Drawing Nos. 385TW7 5XF V1.01 Rev 1.0 Sheets 1 and 2 received 28th August 2003, which increases the original volume of the house at 385 London Road, Isleworth, by 35.35m3, would be lawful within the meaning of section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe proposed development falls within Class B of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995. Planning permission is therefore not required.\r\n\r\nNote: The rooflights to be installed in the front roof slope are to be flush with the roof.\r\n"
